{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "cda2851187e787c6eab839fe4c5d3707ace1559355d4d3e060325322617673c0", "ja": "ううっ……ぐすっ。ずび……。\nびえ～ん！！！", "zh": "呜呜……抽泣。吸溜……。\n哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1001_p", "source_sha256": "aa14b1f7fdb2f95d5775bce1ec500c3f67f72a5a3e774a9e5b31a34249f2e5fc", "ja": "（この声は……紗代子！？）", "zh": "（这个声音是……纱代子！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e59e033ab75c69c9f9303f6180df404e0e1706bc9808ce6ef04e66b7ae8eec3f", "ja": "紗代子！　どうした！？　まさか怪我とか！", "zh": "纱代子！怎么了！？该不会是受伤了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "0f92cbbcdc82bcbb9b03756420106344e28999faf6103e7db8e8ae84a0173eb0", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……。ぐすっ、\nいえ、どこも怪我は……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……呜、没有，\n我没受伤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1004_p", "source_sha256": "52fa8fe9f4aef085bb8c1588f04428495f1722a64bd37134aea8971c31ba26e2", "ja": "それじゃ、何か嫌なことがあったとか？", "zh": "那么，是遇到什么不开心的事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "59881566f5b2200f67efd5ec95f61eb5d109b84a12f918b485c992228d22a751", "ja": "違います、ほら、これ！　あの番組の、卒業生の合唱！\n動画でまた観てたら……。", "zh": "不是的，你看，是这个！那个节目的毕业生合唱！我又用视频看了一遍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1006_p", "source_sha256": "beee4aa13235360e22742f3cb8982363e5ab6f046be613aefa2d9309394e1f93", "ja": "あ、卒業式コラボの？　じゃあ、感動で泣いてたのか。\n……気に入ってるんだな、そのシーン。", "zh": "啊，是毕业典礼联动的那个？那你是感动得哭了啊。\n……你很喜欢那一幕呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "530563a42656a5646217879e75b064579da9ac62870d362a72a61b72f6c90010", "ja": "はい！　なんかもう、ここでみんな、思い出の青春から\n新たな青春に旅立って行くんだな～って思ったら。", "zh": "是的！总觉得，大家将在这里从充满回忆的青春，踏上新的青春旅程～当我这么一想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "b0df10f85fcace6a169795ec9baf4c031a9200774e88cab1ea47d3de5d26d509", "ja": "う、ううっ……！　うう～っ！！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……！呜呜～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a8f9c918de453643d2c561217ed09c07841056dfe346b8220b09f6ee1657db9c", "ja": "そ、そんなに泣かれると……、\nいや、泣いてもいいのか？　……うん、いいか。", "zh": "你、你哭得这么厉害的话……  \n不，哭出来也没关系吧？……嗯，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "1b2f5d9d5ba631d4d8bdc2ba5c85f2df969bceef7e912d4c1633b47bab6bcfd5", "ja": "ああ～！　みんな～！　幸せになってね～！！", "zh": "啊啊～！大家～！一定要幸福哦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5d385a7eefe5809a3573a9fd848969ddd6f7d534f54a57d6a9aa2ac0eab90b9e", "ja": "紗代子は感情の起伏が激しいよな。\nでも、感動の涙のほうでよかったよ、てっきり……。", "zh": "纱代子的情绪起伏还真大啊。不过，还好是感动的眼泪，我还以为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "1107238cfe713d379f99064e90182616ec1994d164f58d1b73888d7dfd81ed57", "ja": "あ、びっくりさせちゃいましたよね！\nこんな大泣きしてたら……。", "zh": "啊，吓到您了吧！\n哭得这么厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "831150994974d76d3b1690fd247df6d30a65328441f1afacd5602dfe7499c983", "ja": "う……今さら恥ずかしくなってきちゃいました。\n私、子供みたいでした……？", "zh": "呜……事到如今，我反而觉得好丢脸啊。\n我刚才……是不是很像个小孩子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4c8616e23d6f45f3adc2dfe01e329a0ef20e15cb260b5f3e781d81df3a65780d", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。\n公衆の面前ってわけでもないし。", "zh": "不，没关系。\n又不是在大庭广众之下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1015_p", "source_sha256": "06972b5f27dc5470e20dddd482c1b8651bf91a5e19de8f84ba3b2ac6a25e17eb", "ja": "むしろその感受性の強さは紗代子の原動力だ。\nこれからも熱く、感情的に行こうな。", "zh": "不如说那种丰富而敏锐的感受力，正是纱代子的原动力。\n今后也保持这份炽热与真情实感，继续前进吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "0989d1eeb236aba95e025b1afd4ab00e042bcbc96c958cf3f5b7350a2b66443d", "ja": "{$P$}……、わかりました！\nうう、なんて熱い言葉を……うえ～ん！！", "zh": "{$P$}……，明白了！\n呜呜，好热血的话语……呜哇——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0633_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f5d1f8ef370b0aa936ba063970f6f28f7f9de083198091ac4e92706a7626e550", "ja": "（また泣いてしまったが……この涙が、\n紗代子を次のステージに導いてくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（虽然又哭了……但这眼泪一定会带领纱代子走向下一个舞台吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
